# AK_Golden_Vlog
# Warm, sunlit lifestyle look. Warms midtones and highlights, keeps shadows slightly cool so the warmth reads as sunlight rather than an orange cast.
# Best for: Golden hour, cafes, interiors, anything you want to feel inviting.
# Apply AFTER a D-Log M -> Rec.709 conversion, not instead of one.
